mcp-server-datovka (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add report_message_spam tool: report a received message as spam to the
    ISDS operator (libdatovka isds_SuspMessageReport). Deliberately usable
    even when READ_ONLY is enabled; allow_complete has no default so the
    caller must decide whether ISDS may download the complete message.
    Needs libdatovka >= 0.8.0, otherwise the tool returns a clear error.
  * save_attachments now writes only under DATOVKA_SAVE_DIR (default
    ~/datovka-attachments), never follows symlinks or overwrites files.
  * Add date range support and file saving to the message tools, tool
    titles and annotations.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0100

mcp-server-datovka (0.2.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add get_sent_message tool: download a sent message in full (envelope
    plus documents), mirroring get_message for received messages. Uses
    libdatovka's isds_get_signed_sent_message, which python3-datovka binds
    but does not yet wrap.

 -- David Esner <esnerda@gmail.com>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

mcp-server-datovka (0.2.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add READ_ONLY mode (default true) that blocks send_message,
    send_text_message, and mark_message_read — matching the AbraFlexi MCP
    safety posture so an LLM cannot mutate a production data box by
    accident.
  * Add tests/live_capability_scenario.py for live read audits and write
    guards; document DATOVKA_URL testing vs production endpoints and ship
    .env.example.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 11:35:00 +0200

mcp-server-datovka (0.2.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add file_path support to send_message attachments, so large files no
    longer have to pass through the calling LLM's context as base64.

